{
  "comment": "Shared argv contract for the tools page (issue #255). Executed by scripts/check-argv-parity.ts (npm run lint:argv-parity) against src/pages/ToolsPage/toolActionArgs.ts, and by src-tauri/tests/argv_parity.rs against the builders in src-tauri/src/mise.rs. Changing a builder on one side without the other, or changing the table without both, fails the guard on the side that no longer matches.",
